# Files and directories excluded from the distributable plugin.
#
# The repository is not the product. Everything below exists to build, test or document the
# plugin, and none of it should reach a site that installs it — so `npm run package` copies
# only what is not listed here.
#
# One line per path or glob, matched against the path relative to the plugin root.

# Version control and editor state
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.idea

# Build sources and toolchain
ui
.distignore

# Developer-facing readme. Users get readme.txt, which WordPress renders on the plugin page.
README.md

# Local development environment
node_modules
*.log

# Credentials — belt and braces; ui/ is excluded wholesale above
.npmrc

# Output of this very step
*.zip
